# GitHub's language bar counts what people write, not what a tool generates. The files below are
# generated, so they are marked and left out of the statistics (and the diffs of generated files
# are collapsed by default on GitHub). Added on 1 November 2026 with the TypeScript build
# (TS-STEP-1), on GDPRLetterBuilder's and UsernameGenerator's .gitattributes.
#
# As each hand-written JavaScript file moves to TypeScript, its compiled .js is added here: the
# compiled files are written by tools/build-ts.sh; edit the TypeScript, never the .js.
#
# gate.js, the first-run notice, is written by build-gates.py at the root of the GitHub folder,
# shared by every Labs app; it is not edited here.
/gate.js linguist-generated=true
# types/stamped-imports.d.ts is written by types/stamped-imports.mjs from the ?v= stamps (until the
# last hand-written JavaScript file is gone, when both are deleted).
/types/stamped-imports.d.ts linguist-generated=true
# The engine's modules, compiled from ts/src/ (one per commit while the move goes on).
/src/core/bytes.js linguist-generated=true
/src/core/taxonomy.js linguist-generated=true
